      "works_on": ["ingredient/egg"],
      "with": ["ingredient/oil"],
      "text": "Heat most of the {oil} in a wok over high heat until very hot. Pour in the {egg:plural}; they puff at once. Push them gently around until they set in large, soft curds that are still a little runny, then tip them onto a plate.",
